                "text": "It's time to invest in peace, it's time to invest in children, and it's time to invest in America.\n\n1.  American Dream Accounts: $20k at HS graduation\n2. End homelessness and build 7m homes\n3. Physical & Emotional Healthcare coverage for all \n4. Debt-free education PreK-college \n5. Fix Social Security\n6. Secure our borders & streamline immigration\n7.  Term limits for Congress & SCOTUS\n8. Conserve America's financial and natural resources\n\nA new generation is ready to get to work. Together.",
